Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,生锈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rusted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,十七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daybreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,火炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furnace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,回祖国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homecoming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freight car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个任务要交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a mission for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,制裁和取回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanction and extract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}No witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:11.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉各斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现今）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的片区巡警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard beat cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警察局）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,街区安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个不错的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,南角有台自动取款机 也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an ATM in the south corner, which means…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,两条交叉街道都是单行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both cross streets are one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算是很好的逃跑路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}So compromised escape routes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我们的目标不在乎被看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means our guy doesn't care about being seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不怕在逃跑时造成混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he isn't afraid to make a mess on the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到半个街区外的那辆逍遥了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that Range Rover halfway up the block?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 红色那辆吗 还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the red one. It's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是防弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's also bullet proof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着是私人保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means private security, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也意味着更多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means more guns, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着会让某些人更加头疼 比如我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means more headaches for somebody, probably us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我能用意念移动物体吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys know I can move things with my mind, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心谨慎必须成为你的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking over your shoulder needs to become second nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟你说过你有点多疑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody ever tell you, you're a little paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没当面说过 怎么 你听到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to my face. Why, did you hear something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 精神集中点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on target, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是半年来最可靠的关于朗姆洛的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best lead we've on Rumlow in 6 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to lose him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他看到我们 那就不是问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he sees us coming that won't be a problem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算是恨死我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he kind of hates us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 看到那辆垃圾车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, see that garbage truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tag it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行X光扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me X-ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:44.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重量分析：货物重13825公斤）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最大载重）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:47.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（轮廓扫描）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车达到了最大载重 驾驶员有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck's loaded for max weight, and the driver's armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是辆冲撞车 - 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a battling ram. - Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标不是警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not hitting the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:01.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传染性疾病研究所）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹衣都是AR15\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body armor. AR15s{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现七名敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make 7 hostiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make 5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗姆洛在三层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumlow's on the third floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 旺达 就像练习时那样 - 那毒体呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanda. Just like we practice. - What about the gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:52.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生物危害品）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,装走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:17.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朗姆洛拿走了生物武器 - 我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rumlow has a biological weapon. - I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕这招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work like that no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,手雷来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 他开装甲战车向北走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. He's in an AFV heading north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带去机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this to the airstrip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑不过他 弃车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna out run him. Lose the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪和我们汇合 - 我们不汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going to meet us? - I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到四个 他们分头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 4, they're splitting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责左边两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the two on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把装备扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ditched their gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,得靠猜了 只有一个人拿走了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shell game now. One of them has the payload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿呢 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻我等好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西不在他这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就把这个扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll drop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下枪 - 他说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop it! - He'll do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器拿到了 谢谢 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payload secured. Thanks, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不要谢那东西 - 他叫红翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not thanking that thing. - His name is Redwing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是不会谢它 - 他多可爱 摸摸他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm still not thanking it. - He's cute. Go ahead, pet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下是为了你拿大楼砸我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for dropping a building on my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到种种情况 我觉得我看起来还算不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I look pretty good, all things considered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的买家是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your buyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he knew you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个朋友 好哥们 你的巴基\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pal, your buddy, your Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 他记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - He remembered you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在场 他还泪汪汪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there. He got all weepy about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就又把他的脑子搅乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till they put put his brain back in the blender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想告诉你句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted you to know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「请转告罗杰斯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Please tell Rogers, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「该走的时候 就得走」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When you gotta go, you gotta go."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得随我一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 我们需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. We need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,消防救援 在大楼南面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire and rescue, on the south side of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.91,0:12:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尽量记住九月的美好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Try to remember the kind of September ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那时草地仍碧绿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When grass was green… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 孩子 跟你父亲告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, dear. Say goodbye to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙发上的流浪汉是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the homeless person on the couch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我爱回家过圣诞的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why I love coming home for Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们就要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before you leave town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好说话 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出国留学好容易回来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been studying abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 学的哪个姑娘 她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, which broad? What's her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你 周一之前别把房子烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favour. Try not to burn the house down before Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那就周一再烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so it's Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 我会据此安排我长袍派对的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is good to know. I will plan my Toga party accordingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲要带我去巴哈马群岛渡个假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's flying us to the Bahamas for a little get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许得先去一趟别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have to make a quick stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去五角大楼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Pentagon. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会喜欢那里餐厅的节日菜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna love the holiday menu at the commissary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说讽刺是衡量一个人潜力的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they say sarcasm is a metric for potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是这样 你以后一定能成为一个伟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's true, you'll be a great man some day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在的时候他非常想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does miss you when you are not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 你也会想我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And frankly, you're going to miss us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我们最后一次在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is the last time we're all going to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道后来发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's about to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点什么吧 不说你会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something. If you don't, you'll regret it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew you did the best you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I wished it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,二元扩张倒退框架 简称「二扩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binarily Augmented Retro-Framing… or "BARF".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 这缩写还得好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I got to work on that acronym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种极其昂贵的通过控制海马体\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extremely costly method, of hijacking the hippocampus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除创伤记忆的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}to clear… traumatic memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't change the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本没能到达机场的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they never made it to the airport, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我为了逃避悲伤所做的那些事 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the things I did to avoid processing my grief. But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再者 我这个治疗实验花费了6.11亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, 611 million dollars for my little therapeutic experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一个正常人都不会赞助这个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in their right mind would ever funded it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我一下 麻省理工的宗旨是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out. What's the MIT mission statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造 传播和保护知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}To generate, disseminate and preserve knowledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他人协作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and work with others, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽全力去挑战世界的极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring to bear on the world's great challenges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 就是他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you, are the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管没有大肆宣传 你们所面临的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quiet as it's kept the challenges facing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是人类所遭遇的最严峻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the greatest mankind has ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 你们大多数都破产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, most of you are broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说 你们之前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, rather you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,即刻生效 在座各位都将得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of this moment, every student has been made an equal recipient{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,九月基金的拨款\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the inaugural September Foundation Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 你们所有人的项目都得到批准资助了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, all of your projects have just been approved and funded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有附加条款 不收税\N{\fnArial\fs30}No strings. No taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手去 改变未来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… reframe the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:19.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在我要请出基金负责人 派珀·波茨）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕犯错 放手做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go break some eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直 真是要窒息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That uh… That took my breathe away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 太慷慨了 那么多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, so generous, so much money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出于好奇问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… Out of curiosity and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拨款会有一部分给教职工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will any portion of that grant be made available to faculty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 真没品 但听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, ew, gross, but hear me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个关于自熟热狗的绝妙点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have got this killer idea for a self cooking hotdog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上就是嵌入化学引燃剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, chemical detonator embedded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗手间在这边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restroom's this way, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 嵌在肉架中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Embedding in the meat shaft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 提词器的事很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark, I am so sorry about the telepromter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道波茨女士不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know Miss Potts has canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没来得及改\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't have time to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}fine. I…I…I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等下再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll catch up later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为那些年轻人做的事真是不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nice, what you did for those young people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也让我的良心好过些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus it helps ease my conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说慷慨与内疚是有关联的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say, there's a correlation between generosity and guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你有的是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you got the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以尽情犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break as many eggs as you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要上去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right where I want to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 职业病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's an occupational hazard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在国务院工作 人力资源部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for the State department. Human resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这让我能养活我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, it enabled me to raise a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很为他的成长骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very proud of what he grew up to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫查理·斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Charlie Spencer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your murdered him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在索科威亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这对你来说毫不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that that matters in the least to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你为我们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you fight for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你只是为自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just fight for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会为我儿子复仇 斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's going to avenge my son, Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. And I blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上月 在尼日利亚拉各斯 11名瓦坎达公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}11 Wakandans were among those killed during a confrontation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在复仇者联盟与雇佣兵的冲突中\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the Avengers and a group of mercenaries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Lagos, Nigeria, last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些通常与世隔绝的瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The traditionally reclusive Wakandans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在袭击发生时 正在拉各斯进行公益服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}were on an outreach mission in Lagos when the attack occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国人民的鲜血洒在了外国领土上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people's blood is spilled on foreign soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是因为犯罪行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only because of the actions of criminals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还因为阻止犯罪的人的冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by the indifference of those pledge to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.87,0:19:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲无辜者取得的胜利 根本算不上胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory at the expense of the innocent, is no victory at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达国王接着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wakanda King went on to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不受国际法的限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are operating outside and above the international law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不回应此类行为 就会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's the reality, if we don't respond to acts like these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺达·马克西莫夫这样的能力增强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What legal authority does an enhanced individual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么法律权利在尼日利亚行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Wanda Maximoff have to operate in Nige…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都怪我 - 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my fault. - That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把电视再打开 他们可指名道姓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then turn the TV back on, they're being very specific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该拆除那件炸弹背心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've clocked that bomb vest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是让你不得不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}long before you have to deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗姆洛提到「巴基」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumlow said 'Bucky' and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间 我又成了那个布鲁克林的16岁少年\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, I was a 16 year old kid again in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这怪我 - 怪我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's on me. - It's on both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This job…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽可能救下更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try to save as many people as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时并不能救每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes that doesn't mean everybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们无法接受这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, if we can't find a way to live with that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次\N{\fnArial\fs30}then next time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们谁都救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe nobody get saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小幻 我们谈过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vis, we talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但门开着 所以我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But the door was opened so I assumed that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长说斯塔克先生回来让我通知他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Rogers wished to know when Mr. Stark was arriving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我马上下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I'll be right down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 走门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll… use the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 他带了位客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and apparently, he's brought a guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,国务卿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Secretary of State.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前 我心脏病发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}5 years ago, I had a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打高尔夫球后挥杆时昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dropped right in the middle of my backswing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果 那成了我人生最大的幸事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned out, it was the best round of my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为经历了13小时的手术和三重搭桥术之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}because after 13 hours of surgery and a triple bypass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了四十年军队生涯没教过我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something 40 years in the army never taught me:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perspective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界欠复仇者联盟一个无法偿还的人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world owes the Avengers an unpayable debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为我们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have… fought for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护了我们 拿生命冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protected us. Risked your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有很多人把你们当成英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But while a great many people see you as heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也有一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,更愿意用「义务警员」这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would prefer the word "vigilantes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用哪个词 国务卿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what word would you use, Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「危险」 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about "dangerous?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会如何形容一群驻扎在美国的能力增强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you call a group of US-based, enhanced individuals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,习惯性地无视主权国家边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}who routinely ignores sovereign borders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪 做什么 全凭自己意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and inflict their will wherever they choose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且老实说 对造成的后果也似乎毫不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who, frankly, seem unconcerned about what they leave behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿特区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington D.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉各斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lagos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.35,0:23:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去四年中\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past 4 years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的行动拥有无限权力而且无人监管\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've operated with unlimited power and no supervision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国政府对这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an arrangement the governments of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已不能再容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}can no longer tolerate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we have a solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:21.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,《索科威亚协议》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sokovia Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,117国批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approved by 117 countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中写明 复仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It states, that the Avengers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是私人组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall no longer be a private organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在一个联合国小组的监督下行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll operate under the supervision of a United Nations Panel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,且是否出动要由该小组决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}only when and if that Panel deems it necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟的成立是为了让世界更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avengers were formed to make the world a safer place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel we've done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 你知道托尔和班纳现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me Captain, do you know where Thor and Banner are right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是搞丢了两个30兆吨级的核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I misplaced a couple of 30 megaton nukes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会有后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can bet there'd be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:24:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妥协 保证 世界就是这样运转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromise. Reassurance. That's how the world works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这就是中间立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, this is the middle ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有应急预案的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there are contingencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.35,0:24:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后 联合国将在维也纳召开会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 days from now, the UN meets in Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:13.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,批准《协议》\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ratify the Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.39,0:24:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, talk it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们的决定你不喜欢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we come to a decision you don't like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们就退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:36.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克利夫兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面停的是你的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your car out front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.76,0:24:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开到人行道上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I jumped the kerb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could, take care of it ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.31,0:25:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你想打电话叫警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you want to call the cops, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.55,0:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}that… that's okay too, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.07,0:25:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用叫警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没怎么变样 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept your looks, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:26:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission report: December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.69,0:26:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫泽莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Zemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会重复一遍我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will repeat my question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.23,0:26:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.65,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,神盾局陷落时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When S.H.I.E.L.D. fell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.23,0:26:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑寡妇公布了九头蛇文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Widow released Hydra files to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.68,0:26:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有数百万页 大都加了密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of pages much of it encrypted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not easy to decipher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.29,0:26:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这两样就什么都能做成\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man can do anything if he has those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.53,0:26:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.83,0:26:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.03,0:26:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇活该灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra deserves its place on the ashheap, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我不介意杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so your death would not bother me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不说 我就得用这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd have to use this book, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他更血腥的手段 来找到我要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other bloodier methods to find what I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't look forward to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.20,0:27:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的死 也只是保住了自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd only be dying for… your pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,国务卿罗斯有一枚国会荣誉勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretary Ross, has a Congressional Medal of Honor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.23,0:27:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你多一枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is one more than you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:27:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么假设我们同意签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's say we agree to this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府过多久就会像追踪普通罪犯那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long does it gonna be before they LoJack us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.43,0:28:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a bunch of common criminals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.54,0:28:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,117个国家要签这份协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}117 countries want to sign this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.11,0:28:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,117个 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}117, Sam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.46,0:28:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就完全不当回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're just like, "No, that's cool. We got it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要做多久两面派\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long are you gonna play both sides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个方程式 - 这样就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have an equation. - Oh, this will clear it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.71,0:28:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生宣布他是钢铁侠后的八年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the 8 years since Mr. Stark announced himself as Iron Man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.67,0:28:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力增强者的数量一直呈指数增长\N{\fnArial\fs30}the number of known enhanced persons has grown exponentially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一段时期里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And during the same period, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.63,0:28:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能引发世界末日的事件数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the number of potentially world-ending events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在同时上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}has risen at a commensurate rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.53,0:28:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 这是我们的错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying it's our fault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这可能有因果关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying there maybe a causality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的超能力招来挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our very strength invites challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战激发冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Challenge incites conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}And conflict…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,会引发灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}breeds catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.13,0:28:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,监管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oversight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们应该给予考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oversight is not an idea that can be dismissed out of hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到点上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.31,0:28:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 你安静得出奇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, you're being uncharacteristically non-hyperverbal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他已经决定好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because he's already made up his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:28:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你真懂我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you know me so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 是电磁头痛犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm nursing my electromagnetic headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才沉默 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's going on, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.78,0:29:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just pain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.63,0:29:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's discomfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.19,0:29:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁把咖啡渣倒进垃圾处理器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's putting coffee grounds in the disposal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是给机车党开了家旅馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I running a bed and breakfast for a biker gang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是查尔斯·斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's Charles Spencer by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.35,0:29:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好孩子 计算机工程专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a great kid. Computer engineering degree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,平均成绩3.6\N{\fnArial\fs30}3.6 GPA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划秋天去因特尔基层上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a floor-level gig at Intel planned for the fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 他想趁窝在办公室里之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, he wanted to put a few miles on his soul, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去积累阅历\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he park it behind a desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看世界 做做义工\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the world, maybe be of service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理不想去维加斯或劳德尔堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie didn't want to go to Vegas or Fort Lauderdale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.22,0:29:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我就会选那些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is what I would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没去巴黎或阿姆斯特丹 那儿多有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't go to Paris or Amsterdam, which sounds fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.25,0:29:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想利用暑假\N{\fnArial\fs30}He decided to spend his summer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.17,0:29:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给穷人建生态住宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}building sustainable housing for the poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜是哪 索科威亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess where, Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.34,0:29:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是想做出些改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to make a difference, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.78,0:29:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们无从得知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we won't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:29:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们打得正高兴时\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause we dropped a building on him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.76,0:29:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他身上砸了一栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we were kicking ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.52,0:30:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全没有决策程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no decision making process here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要受到管制\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be put in check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管以什么形式 我都接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever form that takes, I'm game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不受限制 我们就会无法无天\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't accept limitations, if we're bounderless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比坏人好不到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're no better than the bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.22,0:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 有人死在你眼皮下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, someone dies on your watch, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.23,0:30:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就此放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我们要放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said we're giving up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不对自己的行为负责 就是放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, for not taking responsibility for our actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些文件只是在推卸责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}These documents just shifts the blames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Steve, that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.32,0:30:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话自负得危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is dangerously arrogant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是联合国啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the United Nations we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.98,0:30:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是世界安全理事会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the World Security Council, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.56,0:30:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是神盾局 也不是九头蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not S.H.I.E.L.D., it's not Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但管理者仍是人 人有目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it's run by people with agendas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.94,0:30:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而目的会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and agendas change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.72,0:30:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是好事 所以我才会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.71,0:30:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我意识到我的武器落入敌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized what my weapons were capable of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.60,0:30:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果会多不堪设想时\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the wrong hands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.69,0:30:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就停止生产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shut it down, stopped manufacturing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.35,0:30:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 那是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony. You chose to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.77,0:30:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们签字 就放弃了选择权\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we sign this, we surrender our right to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.66,0:30:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果小组派我们去不该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this Panel sends us somewhere we don't think we should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.02,0:30:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是不许我们去该去的地方呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there's somewhere we need to go, and they don't let us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许不完美 但仍是最可靠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may not be perfect, but the safest hands are still our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果现在不签 将来他们会强迫我们签\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do this now, it's going to be done to us later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.66,0:31:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是如此 到时会闹得很不好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the fact. That won't be pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说他们会来抓我 - 我们会保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're saying they'll come for me. - We would protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.39,0:31:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许托尼是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Tony's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.27,0:31:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们稍作妥协 就还有回旋余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, we have one hand on the wheel we can still steer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果彻底决裂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we take it off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.24,0:31:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the same woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前跟政府叫板的那个女人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who told the government to kiss her ass a few years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是… 审时度势\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… reading the terrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在公众面前犯了些大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have made some very public mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.74,0:31:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要重获他们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to win their trust back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.19,0:31:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我听错了吗 你是在支持我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, did I just mishear you or did you agree with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想反悔了 - 不不 不能收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I want to take it back. - No, no, no. You can't retract it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.27,0:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢啊 真是破天荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Unprecedented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这事结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, case close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.50,0:31:42.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（她在睡梦中去世了）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:32:01.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.00,0:32:25.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛格丽特·佩吉·卡特）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想请莎伦·卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to invite Sharon Carter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上台说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}to come up and say a few words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.30,0:32:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特·卡特为人熟知的身份是神盾局创始人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret Carter was known to most as a founder of S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.43,0:32:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我来说 她只是佩吉姑妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just knew her as Aunt Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她办公室有张相片\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a photograph in her office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.99,0:32:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉姑妈跟肯尼迪并肩而站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Peggy standing next to JFK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.10,0:33:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为孩子 这让我觉得很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a kid, that was pretty cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这也是很大的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, it was a lot to live up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我从不告诉别人我们是亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I never told anyone we were related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在女性饱受歧视的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}how she managed to master diplomacy and espionage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是如何成为一名成功的外交官和间谍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a time when no one wanted to see a woman succeed at either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.48,0:33:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回答说 能妥协就妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said, compromise where you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能妥协就坚持己见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where you can't, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你身边所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if everyone is telling you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都把错的说成对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that something wrong is something right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使全世界都叫你让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if the whole world is telling you to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.46,0:33:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须如大树般稳稳站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your duty, to plant yourself like a tree, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.38,0:33:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,直视他们的眼睛说 “不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}look them in they eye and say, "No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让开”\N{\fnArial\fs30}you move."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.42,0:33:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,被解冻后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came out of the ice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我认识的人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought everyone I had known was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.71,0:34:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来知道她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found out that she was alive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.87,0:34:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只觉得还有她在很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just lucky to have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你也是她的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had you back too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.15,0:34:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁签字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else signed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 罗德 幻视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, Rhodey, Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说自己退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says he's retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 旺达呢 - 待定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanda? - TBD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.81,0:34:23.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,我要去维也纳签《协议》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off to Vienna for the signing of the Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.70,0:34:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上还有好多空位\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of room on the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这虽然是最轻松的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because it's the path of least resistance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.12,0:34:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表就是错的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean it's the wrong path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.43,0:34:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结比团结的方式更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying together is more important than how we stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.51,0:34:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要为此放弃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we giving up to do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.86,0:34:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 小娜 我不能签\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Nat. I can't sign it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.10,0:34:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你一个人面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.31,0:35:12.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（维也纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.67,0:35:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一次特殊的联合国会议中\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a special United Nations conference, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.71,0:35:20.98,Title,0,0,0,0,,117个国家一起正式签署了《索科威亚协议》\N{\fnArial\fs30}117 countries have come together to ratify the Sokovia Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.29,0:35:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 请问是罗曼诺夫小姐吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, Miss Romanoff? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.96,0:35:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要您签个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}These need your signature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.20,0:35:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.53,0:35:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩似乎都不习惯成为焦点人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose neither of us is used to the spotlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟这不总是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not always so flattering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.34,0:35:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到目前表现得还好嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be doing alright so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.36,0:35:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到你之前在国会山的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering your last trip to Capitol Hill, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.69,0:35:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你跟这些人待在一起不会很自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't think you'd be particularly comfortable in this company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.64,0:35:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是这一点就让我感激你能来 罗曼诺夫小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that alone makes me glad you are here, Ms Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.65,0:35:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你不赞成此举吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You don't approve of all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.18,0:35:57.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,那《协议》我支持 政治方面就不敢苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Accords, yes. The politics, not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.24,0:36:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人在一间屋里 效率能胜过百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two people, in a room, can get more done than a 100.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你需要搬钢琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you need to move a piano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.61,0:36:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 父亲 - 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papa. - Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗曼诺夫小姐 - 特查卡国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss. Romanoff. - King T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我为尼日利亚的事道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, allow me to apologize for what happened in Nigeria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.11,0:36:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.84,0:36:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你对我们的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for agreeing to all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.22,0:36:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾罗杰斯队长今天将缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sad to hear that Captain Rogers will not be joining us today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也很遗憾 - 请大家就座\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, so am I. - If everyone could please be seated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议现在正式开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This assembly is now in session.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.29,0:36:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来在召唤我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the future calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.46,0:36:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.99,0:36:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢外交\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man who disapproves of diplomacy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,却做得越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're getting quite good at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.65,0:36:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.34,0:36:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.23,0:36:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.00,0:36:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当失窃的瓦坎达振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}When stolen Wakandan vibranium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被用于制造可怕的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}was used to make a terrible weapon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.45,0:36:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们瓦坎达人被迫质疑我们的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}we, in Wakanda, were force to question our legacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.97,0:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尼日利亚遇害的那些男男女女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men and women killed in Nigeria, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是前去开展慈善活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}were part of a good will mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们的祖国已在阴影中待了太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a country too long in the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 我们不会因不幸而却步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not, however, let misfortune drive us back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会努力让我们想走入的世界更加美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight to improve the world we wish to join.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.28,0:37:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常感激复仇者联盟对此计划的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful to the Avengers for supporting this initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.19,0:37:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦坎达非常骄傲能为和平贡献力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda is proud to extend its hand in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.21,0:37:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈曾劝我不要入伍 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom tried to talk me out of enlisting, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.50,0:38:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但佩吉姑妈没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not Aunt Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第一个大腿枪套就是她送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought me my first thigh holster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常实用 - 还很时髦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very practical. - And stylish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局把你派来了这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA has you stationed over here now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.80,0:38:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去柏林 联合反恐任务小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Berlin, Joint Terrorism Task Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来不错 - 可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds fun. - I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.74,0:38:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been meaning to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在走廊对面监视我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were spying on me from across the hall…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.10,0:38:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我在执行任务的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean when I was doing my job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.77,0:38:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Peggy know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的秘密已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kept so many secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.21,0:38:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望她还要面对你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want her to have one from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你送我回来 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for walking me back. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:39:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 你得看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve. There's something you got to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枚放在新闻车上的炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bomb hidden in a news van{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.91,0:39:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸毁了位于维也纳的联合国大楼 - 是谁在指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ripped through the UN building in Vienna. - Who's coordinating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 他们很可靠 鉴证呢 - 超过70人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. They're solid. Forensics? - More than 70 people have been injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.23,0:39:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少12人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least 12 are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.60,0:39:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括瓦坎达国王特查卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including Wakanda's King T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.14,0:39:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局发布了一段嫌疑人的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officials have released a video of a suspect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.23,0:39:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确认此人正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}who they have identified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬日战士詹姆斯·布坎南·巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}as James Buchanan Barnes, the Winter Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.28,0:39:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名臭名昭著的九头蛇特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infamous Hydra agent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,与数起恐怖袭击和政治暗杀有牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}linked to numerous acts of terrorism and political assassinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给军情六处打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call MI6{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能否让微取证小组快速行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if we can get Micro Forensics to hurry this up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时内得赶过来 不然就没意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the whole team here in two hours or it's not worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.83,0:39:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.77,0:39:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的文化里 死亡并不是终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my culture, death, is not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.20,0:40:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是 前往陌生领域的起点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more of a… stepping-off point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.43,0:40:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向芭丝特与塞赫麦特伸出双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reach out with both hands and Bast and Sekhmet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.16,0:40:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带你走进绿草原 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they lead you into the green veldt where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.97,0:40:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以永远奔跑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can run forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来非常安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds very peaceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.10,0:40:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.93,0:40:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不是我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.37,0:40:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.09,0:40:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,特遣队会决定谁去抓巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Task Force will decide who brings in Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.85,0:40:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用麻烦了 罗曼诺夫小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother, Miss. Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.94,0:40:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill him myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.51,0:40:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.16,0:40:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行 谢谢关心 我挺幸运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah, thanks. I… I got lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你多在乎巴恩斯 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how much Barnes means to you. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.77,0:40:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在家里 别出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只会让局面更糟 让我们都不好做 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll only make this worse for all of us. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.72,0:41:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说你要逮捕我吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you saying you'll arrest me? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.64,0:41:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你出手 会有人抓你的 现在就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will, if you interfere. That's how it works now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.94,0:41:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他都变成这样了 小娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's this far gone, Nat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.97,0:41:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就该由我去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be the one to bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.27,0:41:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.26,0:41:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是最不可能因此丧命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm the one least likely to die trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.58,0:41:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫你别插手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tell you to stay out of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.19,0:41:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她或许有些道理 - 他也会为我出手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Might have a point. - He'd do it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在1945年 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}1945, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.15,0:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确认我们考虑周全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure we consider all our options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.22,0:41:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲你开枪的人 通常最终也会冲我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people that shoot at you, usually wind up shooting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.86,0:41:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,录像公布后收到了很多线报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tips have been pouring in since that footage went public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.63,0:41:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都觉得冬日战士跟他们去一家健身房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody thinks the Winter Soldier goes to their gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分线索都没有价值 除了这一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of it is noise, except for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.10,0:41:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上司现在就要简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss expects a briefing pretty much now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.43,0:41:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能给你这么多情报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's all the answer you're gonna get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.88,0:41:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你得抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - And you're going to have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.12,0:42:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命令是当场击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have orders to shoot on sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.91,0:42:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,回祖国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homecoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.94,0:42:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.56,0:42:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.24,0:42:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freight car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.73,0:42:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆勒先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Muller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have your breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.70,0:42:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔着门就闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could smell it before I opened the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.07,0:42:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,熏猪肋肉和黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Side of bacon and black coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.58,0:42:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您需要 我可以做点儿别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make you something different, if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.72,0:42:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is wonderful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.20,0:42:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮您端到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will just put this on your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.82,0:42:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我自己来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I can manage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.07,0:43:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个怎么样 - 很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.82,0:43:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.94,0:43:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要六个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.96,0:43:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.88,0:43:19.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布加勒斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:48.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冬日战士因维也纳爆炸事件被通缉）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.87,0:44:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.94,0:44:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国特种部队从南面过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}German special forces approaching from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.11,0:44:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.34,0:44:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.56,0:44:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在博物馆里了解过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about you in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.84,0:44:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们设置了警戒线\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've set the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.06,0:44:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有理由紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have plenty of reason to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.33,0:44:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没去维也纳 我不做那种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't in Vienna. I don't do that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.89,0:45:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进入大楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're entering the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为是你的人要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the people who think you did are coming here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.12,0:45:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没准备留你活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're not planning on taking you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.83,0:45:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很聪明 这招不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's smart. Good strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.30,0:45:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们上楼顶了 我得撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the roof. I'm compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.23,0:45:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不非得打起来 巴基\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't have end in a fight, Buck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.22,0:45:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总是要打起来的 - 还有5秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It always ends in a fight. - 5 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从河里救我出来 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pulled me from the river. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.01,0:45:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 3秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - 3 seconds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,突破 突破 突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breach! Breach! Breach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.09,0:45:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门炸开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.48,0:45:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.27,0:45:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀死谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.26,0:46:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谁都不会杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.17,0:46:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯已逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect has broken containment!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.68,0:46:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他顺东楼梯井下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed down the east stairwell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.69,0:48:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 去西南屋顶 - 另一个人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, southwest rooftop. - Who the hell is the other guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.37,0:48:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.13,0:49:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.08,0:49:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 我甩不掉这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I can't shake this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.50,0:49:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.88,0:51:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.18,0:51:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 队长 你是罪犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Cap. You're a criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.73,0:51:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.09,0:52:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放少许辣椒粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pinch of paprika.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.48,0:52:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,少许是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pinch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.24,0:52:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是辣椒粉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that paprikash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.12,0:52:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这或许能让你振奋精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it might… lift your spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.01,0:52:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神振奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirits lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my defense, I… I haven't actually ever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.46,0:52:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没吃过东西 - 能让我来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- eaten anything before, so… - May I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.86,0:52:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.77,0:52:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.65,0:52:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人讨厌你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one dislikes you, Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.90,0:52:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Oh, you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.62,0:52:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.95,0:53:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杏仁体的一种下意识反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}involuntary response in their amygdala{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.29,0:53:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们控制不住害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can't help but be afraid of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.59,0:53:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也怕我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.89,0:53:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的杏仁体是人造的 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}My amygdala is synthetic, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.17,0:53:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前对自己有一定的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think of myself one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.22,0:53:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 自从有了异能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, after this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.80,0:53:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是那个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still me, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.88,0:53:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但世人不这么看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… that's not what everyone else sees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.23,0:53:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, I don't know what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.62,0:53:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不属于这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它给洛基的权杖供能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it powered Loki staff, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也让你拥有了异能 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave you your abilities. But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.07,0:53:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的真正属性依然未知\N{\fnArial\fs30}its true nature is a mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.61,0:53:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而它是我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, it is part of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.63,0:53:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.33,0:53:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.09,0:53:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越了解它 它对我的控制就越小\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I do, the less it controls me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.30,0:53:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许有天 我还能控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, who knows, I may even control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.43,0:54:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是什么 但肯定不是辣椒粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's in this but it is not paprika.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.25,0:54:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去趟商店 20分钟就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go to the store, I'll be back in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.96,0:54:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 我们可以订披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alternatively, we could order a pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.40,0:54:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视 你是不让我离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision, are you not letting me leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.39,0:54:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是为了安全起见 - 我能保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is a question of safety. - I can protect myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.32,0:54:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.37,0:54:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生想避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark would like to avoid the possibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.88,0:54:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再发生公开事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}of another public incident, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.34,0:54:37.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,直到《协议》基本尘埃落定\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the Accords are of a… more secured foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.88,0:54:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.92,0:54:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人像我那样看待你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For people to see you… as I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:54.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.00,0:55:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 你喜欢猫吗 - 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you like cats? - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.86,0:55:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这家伙穿得像个猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Dude shows up dressed like a cat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.30,0:55:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不好奇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't wanna know more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.81,0:55:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服 是振金做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your suit. It's Vibranium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑豹世代是瓦坎达的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Panther has been the protector of Wakanda for generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.32,0:55:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是战士代代相传的衣钵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mantle passed from warrior to warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.35,0:55:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 因为你朋友杀了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now because your friend murdered my father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.25,0:55:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也继承了国王的衣钵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also wear the Mantle of King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.37,0:55:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ask you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.00,0:55:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,既作为战士 又是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}as both warrior and King, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.05,0:56:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你还能保护你朋友多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long do you think you can keep your friend safe from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.98,0:56:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么处置他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,按说你们也该跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing that ought to happen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.05,0:56:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行心理评估 然后引渡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychological evaluation and extradition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.79,0:56:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是埃弗雷特·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Everett Ross, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.75,0:56:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,特遣队副指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy Task Force Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.51,0:56:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那律师呢 - 律师 真可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about a lawyer. - Lawyer, that's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.29,0:56:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们的武器锁好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See their weapons are placed in lock up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.52,0:56:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你写收据的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we'll write you a receipt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.58,0:56:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别让我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better not look out the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.71,0:56:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人穿着我的装备在飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see anybody flying around in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.93,0:56:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为您提供办公室 不会让您进牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be provided with an office instead of a cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.19,0:56:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托您留在办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do me a favour, stay in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.76,0:56:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪也不打算去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't intend on going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.83,0:56:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 这就是更糟的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record. This is what making things worse looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.03,0:56:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:56:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.04,0:57:01.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,罗马尼亚不受《协议》保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romania was not Accords-sanctioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.32,0:57:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德中校在监督善后工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Rhodes is supervising clean up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.09,0:57:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们处理问题期间别再惹麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to break anything while we fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.56,0:57:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,问责吗 当然要问责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequences? You bet there'll be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.93,0:57:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以引用我刚刚说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously you can quote me on that cause I just said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.99,0:57:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有事吗 谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else? Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.52,0:57:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,问责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequences?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.77,0:57:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,国务卿罗斯想起诉你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretary Ross wants you both prosecuted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.16,0:57:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得拿点什么堵他的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to give him something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.49,0:57:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿不回盾牌了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting that shield back, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.69,0:57:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格说 那是政府财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, it's the government's property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.78,0:57:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鹰翼也是 - 太冷酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wings too. - That's cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.54,0:57:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比监狱温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warmer than jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.70,0:57:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.72,0:57:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看点厉害的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to see something cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.62,0:57:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从老爸的档案馆里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled something from dad's archives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉时机正合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt timely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.03,0:58:09.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,罗斯福1941年签《租借法案》时用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}FDR signed the Lend-Lease bill with these in 1941.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为急需帮助的盟军提供了支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provided support to the Allies when they needed it most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.99,0:58:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会说这让我们国家靠近了战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone would say it brought our country closer to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.90,0:58:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是因为这对笔 你就不会在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, if not for these, you wouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.87,0:58:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想 该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to, what do you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.56,0:58:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是橄榄枝 是这么说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an olive branch. Is that what you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.32,0:58:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,派珀来了吗 我没见着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Pepper here? I didn't see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.93,0:58:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are… kinda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.84,0:58:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 其实就是 - 有喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- well not kinda… - Pregnant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.97,0:58:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 绝对没有 我们分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, definitely not. We're taking a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.93,0:58:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都没有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nobody's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.72,0:58:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 托尼 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Tony. I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.90,0:58:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前我差点失去她\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, I almost lost her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我毁了我所有的战甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I trashed all my suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.70,0:58:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们不得不对付九头蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we had to mop up Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.56,0:58:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后又是奥创 这怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Ultron, my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.23,0:58:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后事情一件又一件 我一直没停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, and then, and then. I never stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.62,0:59:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为事实就是我不想停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause the truth is I don't wanna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.53,0:59:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想失去她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to lose her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.69,0:59:07.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,我想或许《协议》是个折衷的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe the Accords could split the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.94,0:59:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,替她说一句 我很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her defense, I'm a handful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.29,0:59:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我爸也不让人省心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, dad was a pain in the ass, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.78,0:59:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他和我妈却很美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}he and mom always made it work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.69,0:59:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴霍华德结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm glad Howard got married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只见过年轻单身的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only knew him when he was young and single.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 你们认识啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh really? You two knew each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.23,0:59:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从没提过 可能就提过一千次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never mentioned that. Maybe only a thousand times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.97,0:59:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我以前真恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I hated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.23,0:59:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意让你为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to make things difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.80,0:59:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 因为你是个非常有礼貌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Because you're a very polite person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.94,0:59:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我觉得情况不妙 我没法无视\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I see a situation pointed south, I can't ignore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.95,0:59:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有时我希望我能 - 你才不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sometimes I wish I could. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.39,0:59:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.56,0:59:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我真想一拳揍在你完美的牙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wanna punch you in your perfect teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不希望你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't wanna see you gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.66,0:59:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.85,1:00:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没出什么不可挽回的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far nothing's happened that can't be undone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.42,1:00:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.75,1:00:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把这24小时的行动合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make the last 24 hours legit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.84,1:00:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯会被转移到一家美国精神病中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes gets transferred to an American psych center{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.77,1:00:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是瓦坎达监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of a Wakandan prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.13,1:00:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是绝对不行 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it's impossible. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.78,1:00:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有保障措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}there would have to be safeguards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.37,1:00:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.97,1:00:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等公关处理好了 这些文件都可以修订\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we put out the PR fire, these documents can be amended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.93,1:00:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经提议让你和旺达复职\N{\fnArial\fs30}I filed a motion to have you and Wanda reinstated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.70,1:00:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 旺达 旺达怎么了 - 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanda? What about Wanda? - She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在被禁足在基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's confined to the compound currently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.28,1:00:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视在陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision's keeping her company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.40,1:00:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 托尼 总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, Tony! Every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.40,1:00:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I think you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.53,1:00:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明理 - 怎么了 100英亩的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- see things the right way… - What? It's a 100 acres{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.79,1:00:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带小泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a lap pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.84,1:00:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放映室 这样保护人已经很好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a screening room. There's worse ways to protect people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.44,1:00:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护 你是这么觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protection? Is that how you see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.07,1:00:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是保护吗 这是拘禁 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is protection? It's internment, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.00,1:00:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是美国公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a US citizen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.96,1:00:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 托尼 - 他们可不会给\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, come on, Tony. - And they don't grant visas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.01,1:00:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大规模杀伤性武器批签证\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Weapons of Mass Destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.30,1:00:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还是个孩子 - 饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a kid! - Give me a break!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing what has to be done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.31,1:01:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能避免我们更糟的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stave off something worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.05,1:01:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就继续自欺欺人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling yourself that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.11,1:01:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对儿的别分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate to break up the set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.77,1:01:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 巴恩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.58,1:01:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是受联合国指派来评估你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been sent by the United Nations to evaluate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.67,1:01:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I sit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.99,1:01:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是詹姆斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your first name is James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.85,1:01:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装备的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}The receipt for your gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.06,1:01:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟服装 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bird costume? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.37,1:01:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't write it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.36,1:01:45.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（保密）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.60,1:01:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来指责你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to judge you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.59,1:01:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to ask you a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.80,1:01:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在哪里吗 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where you are, James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.36,1:01:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不跟我说话 我就没法帮你 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you if you don't talk to me, James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.88,1:02:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫巴基\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.15,1:02:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来送个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.67,1:02:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.13,1:02:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 就在这儿签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Just sign here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.25,1:02:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.72,1:02:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,特遣队为什么要公布这张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the task force release this photo to begin with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.72,1:02:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把消息传出去 让更多人来找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the word out, involve as many eyes as we can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.64,1:02:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.38,1:02:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是逼的人没法藏身的好方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good way to flush a guy out of hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.14,1:02:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆炸弹 被人拍到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set off a bomb, get your picture taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.10,1:02:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让七百万人寻找冬日战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 7 billion people looking for the Winter soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.17,1:02:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说有人为找他而陷害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying someone framed him to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.28,1:02:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 我们找了他两年都一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, we looked for the guy for 2 years and found nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.88,1:03:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没炸联合国 这可非常引人注目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't bomb the UN. That turns a lot of heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.84,1:03:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但这不能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But that doesn't guarantee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.91,1:03:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷害他的人能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that whoever framed him would get him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.51,1:03:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能保证我们会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}it guarantees that we would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.77,1:03:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.32,1:03:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 巴基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.20,1:03:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你目睹了很多事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen a great deal, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.95,1:03:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.46,1:03:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.73,1:03:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一旦开口 恐怖就无法停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you open your mouth, the horrors might never stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.98,1:03:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.35,1:03:34.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（包裹已送达）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.90,1:03:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只谈一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have to talk about one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.28,1:03:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.83,1:04:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的 各位 让我看到巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Come on, guys. Get me eyes on Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.85,1:04:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.00,1:04:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期五 能查到电力中断的源头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}F.R.I.D.A.Y. Can you get me a source on that outage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.43,1:04:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,东地下5层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sub-level 5, east wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我们来谈谈你的家乡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is this? - Why don't we discuss your home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.18,1:04:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是罗马尼亚 也不是布鲁克林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Romania. Certainly not Brooklyn, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.44,1:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你真正的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your real home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.63,1:04:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.63,1:04:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.80,1:04:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,生锈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rusted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.23,1:04:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.44,1:04:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,十七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.82,1:04:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.07,1:04:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daybreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.48,1:04:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,火炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furnace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.05,1:05:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.59,1:05:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回祖国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homecoming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.02,1:05:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.41,1:05:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freight car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.92,1:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.06,1:05:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.64,1:05:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.50,1:05:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.47,1:05:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.87,1:05:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.96,1:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.41,1:06:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭一个帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see an empire fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.31,1:06:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,疏散所有民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evac all civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.51,1:06:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大楼周围拉起警戒 派出武装直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a perimeter around the building and gunships in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带西装（战衣）了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you brought a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然带了 汤姆·福特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure did. It's a lovely Tom Ford, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.92,1:06:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,三件套 两扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}three-Piece, 2 button…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.15,1:06:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是现役非战斗人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a active duty, non combatant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.47,1:06:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.86,1:07:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.35,1:07:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少还认得我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could at least recognise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.13,1:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.84,1:10:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又问了我一次 你会不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me again if you're going to be there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.69,1:10:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I wasn't sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.23,1:10:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看到他那张小脸 尽量赶回来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen his little face. Just try, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.69,1:10:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要睡了 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to bed. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.21,1:10:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,维也纳联合国爆炸案的嫌疑人詹姆斯·巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Barnes the suspect in the UN Vienna bombing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.90,1:10:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日脱逃羁押\N{\fnArial\fs30}escaped custody today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.12,1:10:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时失踪的还有复仇者史蒂夫·罗杰斯队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also missing Avenger Captain Steve Rogers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.34,1:10:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和山姆·威尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sam Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.67,1:10:51.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.83,1:11:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.64,1:11:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.81,1:11:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪一个巴基在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which Bucky am I talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.60,1:11:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈的名字叫萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's name is Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.86,1:11:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前会往鞋里垫报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to wear newspapers in your shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.62,1:11:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆里可不会讲这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't read that in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.56,1:11:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就行了 就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that, we're suppose to be cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.24,1:11:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做了什么 - 不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I do? - Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.11,1:11:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我就知道会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god, I knew this would happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.29,1:11:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇给我灌输的东西都还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything Hydra put inside me is still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.96,1:11:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要说几个词就能激发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do was say the god damn words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.71,1:11:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was he? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.50,1:11:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场陷害你的爆炸 害死了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dead. The bombing. The set up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.95,1:11:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个医生大费周章 就为跟你待上10分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor did all that just to get 10 minutes with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.06,1:12:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能只说句：「我不知道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do better than "I don't know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.53,1:12:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道西伯利亚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to know about Siberia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.35,1:12:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被关押的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I was kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.97,1:12:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道具体位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to know exactly where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.67,1:12:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要知道这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he need to know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.00,1:12:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为冬日战士不止我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm not the only Winter Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.60,1:13:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.72,1:14:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.10,1:14:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁 - 精英敢死队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who were they? - Their most elite death squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.41,1:14:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇史上杀人数最多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}More kills than anyone in Hydra history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.71,1:14:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是在注射血清之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was before the serum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.84,1:14:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都变得跟你一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all turned out like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.24,1:14:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.00,1:14:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个医生能控制他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor, can he control them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.80,1:14:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,八九不离十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.34,1:14:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他想毁灭一个帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he wanted to see an empire fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.83,1:14:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那些人的帮助 他就做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these guys he could do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.47,1:14:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会30种语言 来去不着痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They speak 30 languages, can hide in plain sight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.25,1:14:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗透 暗杀 颠覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}infiltrate, assassinate, destabilize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能在一夜之间毁灭一个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can take a whole country down in one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.88,1:14:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得你措手不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd never see them coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.88,1:14:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,搁在一周前这事会简单得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would've been a lot easier a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.57,1:14:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们告诉托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we call Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.52,1:14:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不会相信的 - 即便他信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he won't believe us. - Even if he did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.12,1:14:59.41,Title,0,0,0,0,,谁知道《协议》会不会允许他帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows if the Accords would let him help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.92,1:15:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.24,1:15:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.99,1:15:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.22,1:15:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你不知道他们在哪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you have any idea where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.99,1:15:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会知道的 边防9队守着国界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will. GSG-9's got the borders covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.32,1:15:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察机也在全天候搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recons flying 24/7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.65,1:15:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会有发现 我们就去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get a hit. We'll handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.82,1:15:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 斯塔克 这事不归你处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it, Stark. It's not yours to handle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.06,1:15:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你显然无法客观对待此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear you can't be objective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.46,1:15:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让特种部队负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting special ops on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.02,1:15:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果交上了火怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens when the shooting starts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.51,1:15:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀了史蒂夫·罗杰斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you kill Steve Rogers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.66,1:15:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不乖乖就范\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're provoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.29,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是罗杰斯 我们在罗马尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes would've been eliminate in Romania{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.32,1:15:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能消灭巴恩斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.88,1:15:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些本不该死的人因此丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are dead people who would be alive now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.61,1:15:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒想想我说没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to check my math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.15,1:15:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.92,1:15:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事凭武力是解决不了的 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not gonna solve this with boys and bullets, Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.52,1:15:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让我们去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to let us bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.60,1:15:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次和上次又会有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would that end any differently than last time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.76,1:15:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我不会穿便装行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this time I won't be wearing Loafers and a silk shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.75,1:15:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,72小时 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}72 hours, guarantee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.17,1:15:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,36小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}36 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.50,1:15:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.31,1:15:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.13,1:16:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.36,1:16:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.16,1:16:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我左手臂麻了 这是正常现象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My left arm is numb, is that normal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.27,1:16:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.93,1:16:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.61,1:16:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,36小时 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}36 hours, jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.06,1:16:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们人手严重不足 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're seriously understaffed. - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.55,1:16:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果绿巨人在就好了 有他的线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be great if we had a hulk, right about now. Any shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.57,1:16:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得他会站我们这边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think he'd be on our side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.40,1:16:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.44,1:16:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个主意 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have an idea. - Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.43,1:16:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的在哪 - 楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's yours? - Downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.46,1:16:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.63,1:16:46.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皇后区）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.63,1:17:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅婶婶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.61,1:17:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天学校顺利吗 - 还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was school today? - It was okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.54,1:17:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辆豪车停在外面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crazy car parked outside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.48,1:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.39,1:17:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What are you doing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.36,1:17:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm-I'm-I'm Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.79,1:17:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是托尼 - 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony. - What are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.39,1:17:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you-What are you-What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.95,1:17:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该见见了 你收到我邮件了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time we met. You've been getting my e-mails, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.30,1:17:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到了吧 - 收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.28,1:17:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于… - 你没告诉我基金的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Regarding the… - You didn't tell me about the grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.62,1:17:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基金的事 - 九月基金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About the grant. - The September Foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.08,1:17:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 记得你申请了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Yeah. Remember when you applied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.84,1:17:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得 - 我批准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I approved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.34,1:17:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事现在就算成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, we're in business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.93,1:17:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没告诉过我 这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me anything. What's up with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.80,1:17:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在还瞒我事了吗 - 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're keeping secrets from me? - Why, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.12,1:17:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很喜欢惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know how much you love surprises, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.69,1:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想等回头再告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I thought I would let you know… wh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.86,1:17:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 我申请了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, what did I apply for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.96,1:17:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我来要解决的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm here to hash out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.77,1:17:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 解决 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hash, hash out, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.63,1:17:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她居然都当婶婶了 简直难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so hard for me to believe that she's someone's aunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.44,1:18:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 什么样的婶婶都有嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, we come in all shapes and sizes, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.30,1:18:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个核桃红枣面包太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This walnut date loaf is exceptional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.45,1:18:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能先停停吗 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me just stop you there. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个基金 是跟钱有关的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this grant, like, got money involved or whatever? No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.13,1:18:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.63,1:18:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 资金非常充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - It's pretty well funded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.73,1:18:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不看看我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who you're talking to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.66,1:18:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能跟他谈五分钟吗 - 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I have 5 minutes with him? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.58,1:18:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为核桃红枣面包 这味道还不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As walnut date loaves go, that wasn't bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.91,1:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 复古科技吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here, retro tech, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.91,1:18:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二手店 救世军 - 捡的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thrift store? Salvation army? - Uh, the garbage actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.99,1:18:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是捡垃圾的 - 对 我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a dumpster diver. - Yeah, I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.04,1:18:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.69,1:18:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对没申请过你的基金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I definitely did not apply for your grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.83,1:18:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我先说 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me first. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.05,1:18:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个反问的问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question of the rhetorical variety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.19,1:18:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.56,1:18:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.39,1:18:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思 - 就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you. What do you… - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.12,1:18:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.59,1:18:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,接得漂亮 时速40英里 三千磅的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, nice catch! 3000 pounds. 40 miles an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.09,1:18:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不容易 你很厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy. You got mad skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.82,1:18:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Youtube上的吧 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all-That's all on Youtube though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.83,1:18:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在那儿找到的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that's where you found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.52,1:19:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些可都是假的 是电脑特效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause' you know that's all fake. It's all done on a computer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.36,1:19:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那个视频一样 什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like that video, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.73,1:19:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对 就像凤凰城上空的飞碟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah yeah yeah… you mean like those UFOs over Phoenix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.42,1:19:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.46,1:19:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.39,1:19:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.36,1:19:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.18,1:19:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是蜘蛛… 娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the… Spider…Ling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.19,1:19:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打击犯罪蜘蛛… 蜘蛛男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime Fighting Spider… You're Spider-Boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.77,1:19:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}S… Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就穿这连体睡衣 还叫侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in that onesie, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是连体睡衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a onesie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.53,1:19:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.12,1:19:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天其实还真挺顺利的呢 斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually having a real good day today, you know, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.82,1:19:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没误地铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't miss my trains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.79,1:19:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫不费力地捡到一台质量很好的DVD机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This perfectly good DVD player was just sitting there and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.74,1:19:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,代数考试也轻松搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Algebra test. Nailed it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.20,1:19:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁知道 有人知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else knows? Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.29,1:19:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.71,1:19:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你那位异常迷人的婶婶也不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your… unusually attractive Aunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.83,1:19:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.82,1:19:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.18,1:19:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她知道 她会抓狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she knew, she would freak out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.93,1:19:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抓狂 我就慌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when she freaks out, I freak out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.74,1:19:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我觉得什么很厉害吗 这个网\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think is really cool? This webbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.17,1:20:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗拉强度简直爆表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tensile strength is off the charts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁制造的 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who manufactured them? - I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.85,1:20:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climbing the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.02,1:20:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的 粘性手套吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing that? Adhesive gloves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.10,1:20:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story. I was uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.79,1:20:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 戴这东西还能看见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lordy! Can you even see in these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.10,1:20:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 我能看见 - 我瞎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Yes, I can! I can. - I'm blind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.48,1:20:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看见的 好吗 就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can-I can see in those. Okay? It's just that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.92,1:20:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事发生之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}when… whatever happened happened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.47,1:20:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的感官变得超级敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like my senses have been dialed to 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.59,1:20:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收的信息实在太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's… There's way too much input, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.12,1:20:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以戴那个能帮我集中注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}they… they just kinda help me focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.87,1:20:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续升级装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in dire need of an upgrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.52,1:20:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到脚 系统化地升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systemic, top to bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.12,1:20:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部翻新 我就是为此而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}100-point restoration. That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.91,1:20:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.52,1:20:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要问问 你的动力是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to know. What's your M.O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.47,1:20:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么激励你早上起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gets you out of that twin bed in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.26,1:20:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.61,1:20:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我这辈子一直都是平凡的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I've been me my whole life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.62,1:20:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前我得到了这些能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've had these powers for 6 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.82,1:20:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读书 搭建电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read books, I build computers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.52,1:21:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我很想去打橄榄球\N{\fnArial\fs30}And-And yeah. I would love to play football.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.17,1:21:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我之前打不了 所以现在又不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't then so I shouldn't now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.92,1:21:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 因为你变了 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. 'Cause you're different. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.67,1:21:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能说出去 所以我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't tell anybody that, so I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.34,1:21:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有了这份能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when you can do the things that I can, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.65,1:21:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.52,1:21:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后发生的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the bad things happen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.15,1:21:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}they happen because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.49,1:21:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想帮助小人物 你想尽一份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wanna look out for the little guy. You wanna do your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.54,1:21:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这世界更美好什么的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the world a better place all that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.20,1:21:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就是帮助小人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah just looking out… for the little guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.92,1:21:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's-That's what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.99,1:21:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要坐这儿 腿移开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to sit here, so you move the leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.22,1:21:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有护照吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a passport? - Uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.74,1:21:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连驾照都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't… don't even have a driving license.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.97,1:22:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过德国吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever been to Germany?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.19,1:22:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你会喜欢那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Oh, you'll love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.46,1:22:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能去德国 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't go to Germany! - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.99,1:22:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有作业呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got… homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.02,1:22:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会当你没说那话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, I'm gonna pretend you didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.47,1:22:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我认真的 我不能辍学\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm-I'm being serious! I can't just drop out of school!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.16,1:22:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有点危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be a little dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.20,1:22:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好跟漂亮婶婶说一声我要带你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better tell Aunt Hottie I'm taking you on a field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.00,1:22:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉梅婶婶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.64,1:22:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.47,1:22:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我解开 - 抱歉 我这就弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me out of this. - I'm sorry, I'll get that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.92,1:22:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 请待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Stay here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.48,1:22:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来我该敲门的 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess I should have knocked. - Oh my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.07,1:22:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来做什么 - 放孩子的鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Disappointing my kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.47,1:23:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该带他们去滑水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm suppose to go water skiing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.71,1:23:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是队长需要我们帮忙 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Cap needs our help, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.83,1:23:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.36,1:23:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.25,1:23:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.93,1:23:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才退休了5分钟 世界就乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retired for, what, like 5 minutes? And it all goes to shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.12,1:23:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请考虑一下你行为的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please consider the consequences of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.65,1:23:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they're considered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.20,1:23:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.35,1:23:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.82,1:23:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闯的祸够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've caused enough problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.21,1:23:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮忙 旺达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to help me, Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.73,1:23:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要闷闷不乐不如去上高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look you want to mope you can go to high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.51,1:23:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想弥补 就给我行动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make amends. You get off your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.11,1:23:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.43,1:23:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道我该先活动下筋骨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I should have stretched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.87,1:24:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克林特 你打不过我 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clint, you can't overpower me. - I know I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.83,1:24:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, she can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视 够了 放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision. That's enough, let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.97,1:24:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要走了 - 我不能让你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm leaving. - I can't let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.24,1:24:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.14,1:24:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.31,1:24:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人会永远害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will never stop being afraid of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的恐惧我控制不了 但我的可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control their fear, only my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.54,1:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 还有一站呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We got one more stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.90,1:25:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.50,1:25:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的卫星在进行面部识别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our satellites are running facial, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.45,1:25:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物识别和行为模式扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}biometric and behavioral pattern scans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.43,1:25:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 别逼我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, or you will be moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.12,1:25:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然那会很有看头\N{\fnArial\fs30}As entertaining as that would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.05,1:25:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得你能找到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you can find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.66,1:25:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的资源很可观\N{\fnArial\fs30}My resources are considerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.50,1:25:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 世界花了70年时间才找到巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it took the world 70 years to find Barnes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.87,1:25:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概花一半时间就能做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you could probably do that in about half the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.65,1:25:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.43,1:25:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个知道的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know someone who does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.06,1:25:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恐怕不太明白什么叫逃跑车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure you understand the concept of a get-away car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.03,1:25:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's low profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.57,1:25:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这些东西可是很招眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, 'cause this stuff tends to draw a crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.17,1:25:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能把座椅往前点吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you move your seat up? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.27,1:25:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又欠你个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.96,1:25:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping a list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.58,1:25:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前可企图杀我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he kind of tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.29,1:25:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那个我也会记着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I'll put it on the list, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.29,1:26:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.97,1:26:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.45,1:26:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.46,1:26:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这真是 - 早该了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was… - Late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.70,1:26:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.10,1:26:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该走了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should go. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.80,1:26:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.49,1:27:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不是别无选择也不会找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I wouldn't have called If I had any other choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.14,1:27:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是帮我忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey man, you're doing me a favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.81,1:27:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 我还要还债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides… I owed a debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.42,1:27:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢支持我 - 我该行动起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for having my back. - It was time to get off my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.35,1:27:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个新人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about our other recruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.07,1:27:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迫不及待呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's raring to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.36,1:27:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了他点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to put a little coffee in him… but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.11,1:27:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}he should be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.26,1:27:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪个时区\N{\fnArial\fs30}What timezone is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.24,1:27:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.99,1:27:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国队长 - 朗先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain America. - Mr. Lang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.30,1:27:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是荣幸 我握得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor. I'm shaking your hand too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.84,1:27:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太赞了 美国队长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is awesome. Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.09,1:27:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我也认识 你好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you too, you're great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.14,1:27:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.88,1:27:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I wanted to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.11,1:27:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认识很多厉害人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know a lot of super people, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.31,1:27:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢想到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for thinking of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.24,1:27:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 好啊 小豆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man. - What's up tic-tac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.73,1:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴 那个 上次的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you. Look. Look, what happened last time when I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.80,1:27:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是场很棒的面试 但绝不会再有下次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a great audition, but it'll… it'll never happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.47,1:27:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉你我们要对付什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell you what we're up against?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.75,1:28:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是几个疯子刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about some… psycho assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.29,1:28:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们的行动不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're outside the law on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.51,1:28:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你跟我们来 就是通缉犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you come with us, you're a wanted man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.07,1:28:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,早习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, what else is new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.47,1:28:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该走了 - 有架直升机等着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should get moving. - We got a chopper lined up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.42,1:28:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在疏散机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're evacuating the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.24,1:28:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 - 斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stark. - Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.89,1:28:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,换装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.12,1:28:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机场总能碰到熟人 真是怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so weird how you run into people at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.82,1:28:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说是不是 - 非常怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you think that's weird? - Definitely weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.76,1:28:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个精神病医生 他才是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doctor, the psychiatrist, he's behind all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.75,1:29:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 队长 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.54,1:29:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.76,1:29:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯给了我36小时带你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross gave me 36 hours to bring you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.08,1:29:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了24小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 24 hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.91,1:29:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮兄弟一把啊 - 你抓错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you help a brother out? - You're after the wrong guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.32,1:29:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的判断力有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your judgment is askew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.29,1:29:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老战友昨天杀了很多无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old war buddy killed innocent people yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.94,1:29:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有5个跟他一样的超级战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are 5 more super soldiers just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.40,1:29:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让那个医生先找到他们 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let the doctor find them first, Tony. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.70,1:29:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.68,1:29:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道接下来会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what's about to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.33,1:29:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次也要打出一条血路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to punch your way out of this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.76,1:29:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我没耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I've run out of patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.86,1:29:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,内衣宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underoos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.27,1:29:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.98,1:29:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 落地不太理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Well, I could've stuck the landing a little better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.01,1:29:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,新服装… 不太适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… just the new suit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.18,1:29:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这不是事儿 斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, it's nothing, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.45,1:29:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,服装很完美 谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-It's perfect, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.58,1:29:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们不用开始闲扯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we don't really need to start a conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.37,1:29:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Cap… Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.28,1:29:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛侠 你的大粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan, I'm Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.37,1:29:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 回头再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll talk about it later. Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.23,1:29:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家好 - 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, everyone. - good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.31,1:29:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没闲着啊 - 你好傻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been busy. - And you've been a complete idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.33,1:29:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把克林特扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragging in Clint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.24,1:30:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把旺达从她不想离开的地方救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescuing Wanda from a place she doesn't even want to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.50,1:30:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个安全的地方 我在努力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A safe place. I'm trying to keep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.80,1:30:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力阻止你分裂复仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to keep you from tearing the Avengers apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.24,1:30:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你签字时就已经分裂我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that when you signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.69,1:30:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, we're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.35,1:30:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出巴恩斯 跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna turn Barnes over and you're gonna come with us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.55,1:30:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上照做 否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, because it's us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.70,1:30:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支联合特别行动司令部的分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a squad of J-SOC guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.84,1:30:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,会来抓你们 他们下手不会留情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no compunction about being impolite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.83,1:30:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.20,1:30:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.99,1:30:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆式战斗机在北跑道的5号机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quinjet's in hanger five, north runway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.51,1:30:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Lang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.66,1:30:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.62,1:30:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What-What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.16,1:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吧 美国队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this is yours, Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.07,1:30:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好 好了 停车场有俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. Alright, there's two on the parking deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.59,1:30:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个是马克西莫夫 我去抓她\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them is Maximoff, I'm gonna grab her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.70,1:30:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德 你应付队长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey, you want to take Cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.89,1:30:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,候机大厅有俩 威尔逊和巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got two in the terminal. Wilson and Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.13,1:30:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes is mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.50,1:30:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 我该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. Stark, what should I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.94,1:30:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说好了吗 别靠太近 用网缠住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we discussed. Keep your distance. Web them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.92,1:30:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, copy that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.16,1:31:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.81,1:31:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask a second time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.93,1:31:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我真的不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I really don't want to hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.96,1:31:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't stress about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.52,1:31:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么鬼 - 这年头谁都有点花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell was that? - Everyone's got a gimmick now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.88,1:31:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有金属臂 太牛逼了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a metal arm? That is awesome, dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.29,1:31:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.72,1:31:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不住了 队长 虽然不致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Cap. This won't kill you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.01,1:31:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是会挺疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it ain't gonna tickle either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.85,1:32:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺达 我觉得你伤了幻视的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanda, I think you hurt Vision's feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.86,1:32:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我关在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You locked me in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.25,1:32:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先 这说法太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. First, that's an exaggeration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.90,1:32:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 我是为了保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, I did it to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.33,1:32:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克林特 - 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Clint. - Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.76,1:32:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来退休生活不适合你 高尔夫打烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly retirement doesn't suit you. You got tired of shooting golf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.40,1:32:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩18杆 杆杆进洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I played 18, shot 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.87,1:32:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是射不偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just can't seem to miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.53,1:32:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凡事总有第一次啊 - 让你转头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First time for everything. - Made you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.65,1:32:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,检测到多处挫伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple contusions detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.57,1:32:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也检测到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I detected that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.88,1:32:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.25,1:32:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这是你丢的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, I think you lost this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.75,1:33:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这翅膀是碳化纤维的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those wings carbon fiber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.27,1:33:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意是你射出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this stuff coming out of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.58,1:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是 这刚柔度就不难理解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the rigidity flexibility ratio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.76,1:33:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 真是牛逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, gotta say, that's awesome man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.28,1:33:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你参没参加过战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you've been a fight before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.86,1:33:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们一般没这么多废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's usually not this much talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.54,1:33:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不好意思 我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, sorry, my bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.96,1:33:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 我也想继续和你们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look. I'd love to keep this up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.40,1:33:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我今天只有一项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've only got one job here today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.85,1:33:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得给斯塔克先生留个好印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I gotta impress Mr. Stark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.26,1:33:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉了 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, I'm really sorry. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.91,1:33:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能早点那么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have done that earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.64,1:33:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.45,1:33:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.32,1:33:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.53,1:33:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝这玩意扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.31,1:33:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.09,1:33:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.48,1:33:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我以为是辆水车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. I thought it was a water truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.97,1:34:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.31,1:34:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在被惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Now, I'm pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.54,1:34:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是计划的一部分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this part of the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.96,1:34:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来计划对他们客气些的 想加大火力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my plan was go easy on them. You want to switch it up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.55,1:34:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's our ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.67,1:34:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.65,1:34:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.83,1:34:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你相信自己是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you believe what you're doing is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.54,1:34:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为了大局 你必须马上投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, for the collective good, you must surrender now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.87,1:34:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do, Cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.66,1:34:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.71,1:35:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.10,1:35:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没打算停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not stopping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.59,1:35:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不会停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.75,1:35:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还是朋友吧 - 要看你下手多狠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're still friends, right? - Depends on how hard you hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.20,1:35:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were pulling your punches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.45,1:36:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没杀你父亲 - 那你跑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't kill your father. - Then why did you run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.83,1:36:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意根本不符合物理定律啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing does not obey the laws of physics at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.59,1:36:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 这里有很多你不懂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look kid. There's a lot going on here that you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.78,1:36:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生说过你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark said you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.25,1:36:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说要攻击你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also said to go for your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.02,1:36:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 能帮我甩掉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, can you get him off me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.91,1:36:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了吗 - 抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buckled in? - Yeah. No, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.54,1:36:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了 弓箭男 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, arrow-guy. Let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.35,1:37:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克还跟你说别的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark tell you anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.81,1:37:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 你觉得你没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're wrong. You think you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.30,1:37:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes you dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.91,1:37:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得也没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he had a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.03,1:37:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挺有勇气 你从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got heart, kid. Where're you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.23,1:37:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.68,1:37:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我布鲁克林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.09,1:37:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 星期五 - 部分武器系统离线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- F.R.I.D.A.Y.? - We have some weapon systems offline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.26,1:37:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.26,1:37:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计得返厂维修了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you… you're gonna have to take this into the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.96,1:37:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁在说话 - 你的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's speaking? - It's your conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.29,1:37:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最近都没怎么交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't talk a lot these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.27,1:38:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 星期五 - 启动灭火系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}- F.R.I.D.A.Y.? - Deploying fire suppression system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.06,1:38:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.22,1:38:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 那家伙现在都该到西伯利亚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go. That guy's probably in Siberia by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.47,1:38:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把会飞的引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta draw out the fliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.12,1:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应付幻视 你去飞机那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Vision. You get to the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.91,1:38:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们去上飞机 你俩都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you get to the jet! Both of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.96,1:38:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其他人走不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us aren't getting out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.44,1:38:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不想承认 如果我们想打赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I hate to admit it, if we're gonna win this one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.27,1:38:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得有些人输\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of us might have to lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.11,1:38:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真正重要的战斗 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the real fight, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.46,1:38:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 山姆 什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Sam, what's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.03,1:38:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得搞个大动静来转移注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a diversion, something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.13,1:38:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个大家伙 但坚持不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something kind of big, but I can't hold it very long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.44,1:38:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我信号 拼命跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my signal, run like hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.65,1:38:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把自己扯成了两半 也别回来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I tear myself in half, don't come back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.49,1:38:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要把自己扯成两半了 - 你没问题吗 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna tear himself in half? - You sure about this, Scott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.86,1:38:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常这样做 其实就那么一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do it all the time. I mean once…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.65,1:38:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在实验室里 然后我晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a lab. Then I passed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.30,1:38:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最拽 我最拽 我最拽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the boss. I'm the boss. I'm the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.74,1:39:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最拽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.47,1:39:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.94,1:39:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小不点变大了 他变大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, tiny dude is big now. He's big now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.20,1:39:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大概就是信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.50,1:39:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害 小豆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, tic-tac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.63,1:39:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的罗德还我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me back my Rhodey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.79,1:39:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去接他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.39,1:40:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们这边还有谁隐藏了什么惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Anybody on our side hiding any shocking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.01,1:40:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起的能力想展现出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fantastic abilities they'd like to disclose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.34,1:40:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意接受建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm open to suggestions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.40,1:40:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想抓他们 先过我这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get to them? You got to go through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.45,1:40:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't met yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.82,1:40:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是克林特 - 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Clint. - I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.50,1:41:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.94,1:41:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么东西飞进我身体里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something just flew in me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.91,1:41:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会停下的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.77,1:42:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.59,1:42:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定要后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna regret this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.52,1:42:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.19,1:42:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们看过那部超老的电影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. You ever see that really old movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.07,1:42:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国反击战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empire Strikes Back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.27,1:42:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 托尼 这家伙多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Tony, how old is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.90,1:42:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我又没给他碳测年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I didn't carbon date him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.12,1:42:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正挺小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the young side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.41,1:42:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那一段吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that part?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.52,1:42:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们在那个雪星球上 那个会走的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they're on the snow planet? With the walking thingies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.54,1:42:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子的点子可能行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the kid's on to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.69,1:42:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上飞 托尼 往上飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}High now, Tony. Go high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.29,1:42:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.90,1:42:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太牛逼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.19,1:43:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人有橙片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have any orange slices?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.75,1:43:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.67,1:43:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 友军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off me! - Same side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.54,1:43:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.21,1:43:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.05,1:43:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.35,1:43:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吓死人了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was scary. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.65,1:43:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你结束了 知道吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're done. Alright? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.79,1:43:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干得很好 待这儿吧 - 我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did a good job. Stay down. - I'm good. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.23,1:43:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待这儿吧 - 不 我得把他抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay down. - No, it's good I gotta get him back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.51,1:43:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去 否则我打给梅婶婶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going home or I'll call Aunt May!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.12,1:43:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 你收工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. - You're done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.53,1:43:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.68,1:43:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 等等 我还能打 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark, wait! I'm not done, I'm not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.05,1:43:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm done. I'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.40,1:43:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说会帮你找到他 不是抓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that I'd help you find him, not catch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.24,1:43:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有区别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.14,1:44:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.20,1:44:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.24,1:44:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的 灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as I said, catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.27,1:44:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视 我后面有尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision, I got a bandit on my six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.88,1:44:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻视 收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vision, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.22,1:44:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他的推进器 把他变成滑翔翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target his thruster, turn him into a glider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.17,1:44:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.06,1:44:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 我失去动力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, I'm flying dead stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.07,1:45:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.71,1:45:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,读取体征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read vitals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.59,1:45:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,检测到心跳 医疗急救已经上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartbeat detected. Emergency medical is on it's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.13,1:45:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.67,1:45:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 客房服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Room service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.43,1:45:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.74,1:45:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是201房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is room 201…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.50,1:45:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天也要培根和黑咖啡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon and black coffee again today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.82,1:45:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me so well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.90,1:45:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好 早餐送来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Your breakfast is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.73,1:45:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I let myself in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.79,1:46:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆勒先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Muller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.65,1:46:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆勒先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Muller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.50,1:46:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.85,1:46:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen to your friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.21,1:46:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么 我会去面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, I'll deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.05,1:46:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是否值得你这样 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I'm worth all this, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.46,1:46:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些年做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did all those years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.21,1:46:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.20,1:46:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.34,1:46:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.51,1:47:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但终归是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.11,1:47:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.40,1:47:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我分心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.81,1:47:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为没那种可能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think that was possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.34,1:47:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.11,1:47:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说他L4到S1粉碎骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor say he shattered L4 through S1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.60,1:47:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊髓高度撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extreme laceration of the spinal cord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.43,1:47:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概会造成一定瘫痪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably looking at some form of paralysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.56,1:48:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫不会停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve's not gonna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.83,1:48:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也不让步 罗德的情况还算轻的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't either, Rhodey's gonna be the best case scenario.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.13,1:48:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放走了他们 小娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them go, Nat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.43,1:48:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们采取的方式不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We played this wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.65,1:48:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.74,1:48:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 双面间谍一定很难改吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy. It must be hard to shake the whole double agent thing, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.27,1:48:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都深入骨髓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sticks in the DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.25,1:48:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you incapable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.73,1:48:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的自负 哪怕一刻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of letting go of your ego for one god damn second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.75,1:48:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,特查拉把你做的事告诉了罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'Challa told Ross what you did, so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.35,1:48:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来抓你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.78,1:48:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要小心的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one that needs to watch their back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.16,1:48:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 星期五\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking at, F.R.I.D.A.Y.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.44,1:48:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏林警方的优先上传信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority upload from Berlin police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.19,1:48:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire up the chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.00,1:48:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯被捕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Task Force called{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.39,1:48:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,特遣队立刻找了个精神病医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a psychiatrist as soon as Barnes was captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.63,1:49:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,联合国一小时内就调来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The UN dispatched Dr. Theo Broussard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.64,1:49:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,日内瓦的西奥·布鲁萨尔医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Geneva within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.53,1:49:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人去找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was met by this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.97,1:49:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用面部识别查过他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you run facial recognition yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.50,1:49:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我是什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.05,1:49:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不好 我一直脑补一个红发女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I've been picturing a redhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.43,1:49:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的肯定是别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be thinking of someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.60,1:49:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.37,1:49:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,假医生实为赫尔穆特·泽莫上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fake doctor's actually Colonel Helmut Zemo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.43,1:49:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚情报部门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovian intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.78,1:49:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽莫带领索科威亚的秘密刺杀小队回音蝎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zemo ran Echo Scorpion, a Sokovian covert kill squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.49,1:49:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真布鲁萨尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened to the real Broussard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.88,1:49:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被发现死在了一家柏林酒店的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was found dead in a Berlin hotel room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.24,1:49:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方还在房间里找到了假发和面部假体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where police also found a wig and facial prosthesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.90,1:49:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于模拟詹姆斯·布坎南·巴恩斯的特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}approximating the appearance of one James Buchanan Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.18,1:49:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.87,1:49:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发给罗斯 - 是 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get this to Ross. - Yes, Boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.32,1:51:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是孤岛监狱控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Raft Prison control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.34,1:51:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以降落了 斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are clear for landing, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.61,1:51:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 拿到文件了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? You got the files?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.51,1:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们调整卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's reroute the satellites, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.71,1:51:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始对这个泽莫进行面部识别扫描吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}start facial scanning for this Zemo guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.87,1:52:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在莱比锡制造了那么大个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously think I'm gonna listen to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.36,1:52:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我还会听你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}after that fiasco in Leipzig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.73,1:52:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没被关进这里的监狱就算你走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky you're not in one of these cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.77,1:52:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来学家 先生们 未来学家来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The futurist, gentlemen! The futurist is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.19,1:52:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能看穿一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.50,1:52:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道什么是为你好 不管你喜不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what's best for you, whether your like it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.13,1:52:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧 巴顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break, Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.42,1:52:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们会把你们关在这里 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea they'd put you here, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.84,1:52:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们会把我们关起来的 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you knew they'd put us somewhere, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.36,1:52:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但不是一个漂浮在海上的超级监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But, not some super-max floating ocean pokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.30,1:53:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是关疯子 关…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this place is for maniacs. This is a place for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.08,1:53:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.71,1:53:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪犯 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminals, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.92,1:53:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's the word you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.70,1:53:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.29,1:53:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这词以前可不会指我 或山姆 旺达\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't used to mean me, or Sam, or Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.19,1:53:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是被关进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.04,1:53:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你犯法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you broke the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.22,1:53:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 我可没逼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I didn't make you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.64,1:53:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啦啦啦 - 你知法 还犯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blah, blah, blah… - You read it, you broke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.39,1:53:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个大老爷们了 有妻有子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, you're all grown-up. You got a wife and kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.60,1:53:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.30,1:53:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选错队的时候怎么不去考虑他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you think about them before you choose the wrong side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.04,1:53:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家可得提防这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta watch your back with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.26,1:53:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好他要背后坑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chances he's gonna break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.91,1:53:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克·皮姆一向说 斯塔克家人的人不能信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank Pym always said, you never can trust a Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.93,1:53:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.97,1:53:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.28,1:53:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Rhodes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.24,1:53:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天他要被送去哥大医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're flying him to Columbia Medical tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.92,1:53:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有帮助吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… Fingers cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.30,1:53:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么吗 他们给你饭吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need? They feed you yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.86,1:54:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是唱红脸的警察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the good cop now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.12,1:54:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想知道史蒂夫去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a guy who needs to know where Steve went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.83,1:54:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得去找个唱白脸的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better go get a bad cop, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.78,1:54:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我开口 除非像马克·福尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause you gonna have to go Mark Fuhrman' on my ass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.67,1:54:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样对我动大刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get information out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.10,1:54:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们监控的音频关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just knocked the 'A' out of their 'AV'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.26,1:54:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有30秒时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got about 30 seconds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.36,1:54:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就会发现不是设备问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they realize it's not their equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.23,1:54:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么 把声音调出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do? Get it back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.15,1:54:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.05,1:54:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是本该审问巴恩斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause that is the fellow who was supposed to interrogate Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.23,1:54:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我显然是错了 山姆 我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, I made a mistake. Sam, I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.79,1:54:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是头一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.41,1:54:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长现在不知要遭遇什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap is definitely off the reservation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.21,1:54:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会需要一切的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's about to need all the help he can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.02,1:54:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不怎么熟 你不非得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know each other very well. You don't have to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.41,1:54:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.68,1:54:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.42,1:54:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得作为朋友单独去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to go alone and as a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.27,1:54:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.44,1:55:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔克 他说出罗杰斯的下落了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, did he give you anything on Rogers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.21,1:55:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 他叫我下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Told me to go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.27,1:55:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是回基地吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to the compound instead. But, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.74,1:55:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你随时可以打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can call me anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.05,1:55:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你待机 我喜欢看电话闪灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put you on hold, I like to watch the line blink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.04,1:56:10.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗曼诺夫）
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.97,1:56:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那次我们不得不搭冷藏车坐在后面冷库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that time we had to ride back from Rockaway Beach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.27,1:56:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回洛克威海滩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the back of that freezer truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.99,1:56:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你拿我们坐地铁的钱买了热狗的那次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that the time you used our train money to buy hot dogs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.69,1:56:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了替个红发女赢一只玩具熊花了3美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blew 3 bucks trying to win that stuffed bear for a redhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.73,1:56:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫什么来着 - 朵丽丝 你叫她小朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was her name again? - Dolores. You called her Dot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.80,1:56:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在肯定都一百岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got to be a hundred years old right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.80,1:56:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.55,1:56:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定也就到了几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't have been here more than a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.82,1:56:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也足以唤醒他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to wake them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.00,1:57:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.30,1:57:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.11,1:57:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戒心有点强啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem a little defensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.30,1:57:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天挺不容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.18,1:57:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息 士兵 我现在不是冲你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease, soldier. I'm not currently after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.14,1:57:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.64,1:57:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你的说法没那么扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be your story's not so crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.49,1:58:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.00,1:58:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯不知道我来了 我也不希望他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross has no idea I'm here, I'd like to keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.86,1:58:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 我还得逮捕自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I got to arrest myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.93,1:58:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去要办很多公文呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sounds like a lot of paper work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.48,1:58:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你很高兴 托尼 - 我也是 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to see you, Tony. - You too, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.50,1:58:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗脑战士 被你打败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manchurian Candidate, you're killing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.14,1:58:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们休战了 你可以把枪放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a truce here, you can drop…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.33,1:58:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我读取到热信号 - 几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got heat signatures. - How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.15,1:58:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.13,1:59:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这算是安慰 他们是在睡梦中死去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's any comfort, they died in their sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.70,1:59:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我还想要更多你这样的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think I wanted more of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.75,1:59:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.51,1:59:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感激他们 他们把你引来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful to them though, they brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.76,1:59:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别费劲了 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.42,1:59:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联人将这个房间设计成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Soviets built this chamber to withstand the launch blast of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.20,1:59:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以抵挡UR100导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}UR-100 rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.21,1:59:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌我有更强的火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm betting I can beat that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.04,1:59:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 斯塔克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure you could, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.42,1:59:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,假以时日的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.36,1:59:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样你就无从知道你为何而来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you'd never know why you came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.16,1:59:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在维也纳滥杀无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed innocent people in Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.63,1:59:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了引我们来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to bring us here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.48,2:00:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年多来 我满脑子都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about nothing else for over a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.91,2:00:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究你 跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I studied you, I followed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.34,2:00:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你站在这里 我才意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that you're standing here, I just realized…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.21,2:00:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蓝眼睛中还带点绿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bit of green in the blue of your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.23,2:00:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能发现瑕疵真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How nice to find a flaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.34,2:00:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是索科威亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sokovian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.98,2:00:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.55,2:00:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚被你炸毁前早就无药可救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia was a failed state long before you blew it to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.06,2:00:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.38,2:00:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了我的一个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I made a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.95,2:00:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.98,2:00:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.94,2:00:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.03,2:00:51.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1991年12月16日）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.99,2:00:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被敌人颠覆的帝国还能东山再起\N{\fnArial\fs30}An empire toppled by its enemies can rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.44,2:01:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从内部坍塌的帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one which crumbles from within…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.14,2:01:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就永远灭亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's dead… forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.57,2:01:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.18,2:01:17.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1991年12月16日）
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.65,2:01:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.91,2:01:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.78,2:01:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.71,2:01:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.40,2:01:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.31,2:02:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.95,2:02:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony. Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.65,2:02:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.27,2:02:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it was him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.61,2:03:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骗我 罗杰斯 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bullshit me, Rogers! Did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.63,2:03:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.05,2:04:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.60,2:04:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他 托尼 九头蛇控制了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't him, Tony. Hydra had control of his mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.85,2:04:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.84,2:04:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.73,2:04:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,左靴喷气系统损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left boot-jet failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.09,2:04:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行系统受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight systems compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.73,2:04:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.63,2:04:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会罢休的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna stop. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.50,2:05:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.25,2:05:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准系统损坏 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targeting system's knackered, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.43,2:05:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用肉眼瞄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm eyeballing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.09,2:05:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even remember them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.95,2:05:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这改变不了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't gonna change what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.69,2:06:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.59,2:06:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed my mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.50,2:07:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看到他那张小脸 尽量赶回来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen his little face. Just try, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.97,2:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要睡了 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to bed. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.63,2:07:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点杀错了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost kill the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.13,2:07:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是什么无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly an innocent one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.76,2:07:33.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（信息已删除）
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.41,2:07:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all you wanted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.02,2:07:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see them rip each other apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.41,2:07:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲住在城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father lived outside the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.08,2:07:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那儿会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we would be safe there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.85,2:07:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son was excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.03,2:07:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以透过车窗看到钢铁侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could see the Iron Man from the car window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.72,2:07:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉我妻子：「不用担心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I told my wife, "Don't worry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.21,2:07:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们在城里打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They're fighting in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.15,2:07:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离得远呢 不会有事「\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are miles from harm."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.39,2:08:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等灰烬散尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the dust cleared, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.44,2:08:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫声停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the screaming stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.68,2:08:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了两天才找到他们的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me two days until I found their bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.04,2:08:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.38,2:08:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然抱着我的妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}still holding my wife and son in his arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.29,2:08:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而复仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Avengers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.35,2:08:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就那么回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they went home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.01,2:08:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己杀不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I couldn't kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.63,2:08:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我更强大的人都试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More powerful men than me have tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.99,2:08:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我能让他们自相残杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, if I could get them to kill each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.21,2:08:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的事我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.33,2:08:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.93,2:08:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个孝子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a dutiful son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.22,2:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇已经吞噬了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance has consumed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.66,2:09:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也吞噬了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's consuming them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.84,2:09:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让自己也被吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done letting it consume me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.80,2:09:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义很快就会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice will come soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.41,2:09:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和死人说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that to the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.76,2:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,活人还要找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The living are not done with you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.10,2:09:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法靠肉搏打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't beat him hand to hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.92,2:09:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析他的攻击模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Analyse his fight pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.78,2:09:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.19,2:09:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗策略就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countermeasures ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.26,2:09:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好揍他一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kick his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.10,2:10:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.32,2:10:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.33,2:10:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要起来 最后警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down. Final warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.78,2:10:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你耗一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do this all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.27,2:11:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块盾牌不属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shield doesn't belong to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.17,2:11:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你配不上它 那是我父亲制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve it! My father made that shield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.84,2:12:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上八点 晚上五点吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meals at eight and five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.60,2:12:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天可以去两次厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toilet privileges, twice a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.75,2:12:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声说话 电你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your voice, zap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.68,2:12:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰玻璃 电你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch the glass, zap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.93,2:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢做出格的事 我会收拾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You step out of line, you deal with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.97,2:12:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你试试看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, step out of line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.50,2:12:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does it feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.72,2:12:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了那么多时间 费了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend all that time, all that effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.04,2:12:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.06,2:12:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败得\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see it fail, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.48,2:12:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一塌糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}so spectacularly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.32,2:12:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.87,2:13:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是首次测试 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just the first pass. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.22,2:13:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我反馈 想到什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some feedback. Anything you think of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.41,2:13:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,减震 横向移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shock absorption. Lateral movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.03,2:13:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杯架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cup holder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.94,2:13:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许该考虑在下面按空调\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may wanna think about some AC down in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.63,2:13:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我拉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. I'll give you a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.58,2:13:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 别帮我 别帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't. Don't help. Don't help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.56,2:13:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,138次 138次战斗任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}138. 138 combat missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.24,2:14:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我飞过138次战斗任务 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how many I've flown, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.38,2:14:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都可能有去无回 但我还是去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of them could've been my last, but I flew them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.52,2:14:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是必须打的仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause the fight needed to be fought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.69,2:14:10.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,那个《协议》的事也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same with these Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.74,2:14:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我签字是因为那是正确的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I signed because it was the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.13,2:14:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事的确太糟心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, this sucks. This is, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.60,2:14:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.48,2:14:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这没改变我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it hasn't change my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.56,2:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.63,2:14:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.24,2:14:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是托尼·「屎塔克」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Tony "Stank"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.25,2:14:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他就是托尼·「屎塔克」 你来对地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this is-this is Tony "Stank"! You're in the right place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.58,2:14:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.61,2:14:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这梗我要用一辈子 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never dropping that, by the way. - Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.53,2:14:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人桌「屎塔克」先生 坐在厕所边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table for one, Mr."Stank". Please, by the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.67,2:15:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.72,2:15:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你回到了基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're back at the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.62,2:15:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你一个人在豪宅里晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the idea of you rattling around a mansion by yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.09,2:15:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都需要家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.80,2:15:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟属于你 或许多于属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avengers are yours, maybe more so than mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.40,2:15:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从18岁开始就是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on my own since I was 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.71,2:15:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未真正融入哪里 哪怕是在军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really fit in anywhere, even in the army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.87,2:15:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我信任 人 个体\N{\fnArial\fs30}My faith's in… people, I guess. Individuals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.25,2:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴 大部分时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I'm happy to say that for the most part, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.62,2:15:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}they haven't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.34,2:15:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也不能辜负他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I can't let them down either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.73,2:15:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁可以换 但或许不该换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locks can be replaced, but, maybe they shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.05,2:15:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我伤了你 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I hurt you, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.34,2:15:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guessed I thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.59,2:16:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不告诉你你父母的事 是照顾你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}by not telling you about your parents, I was sparing you. But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.04,2:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在明白 我只是在照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see now that I was really sparing myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.12,2:16:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.26,2:16:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你有天能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully one day you can understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:11.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,我也希望我们能在《协议》的事上达成一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we agree on the Accords, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.02,2:16:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.86,2:16:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你只是在做你相信的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're doing what you believe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.26,2:16:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们也都只能做到这点 我们也该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all any of us can do. That's all any of us should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.46,2:16:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,国务卿罗斯的优先来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority call from Secretary Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.54,2:16:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤岛监狱遭人劫狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a breach at the Raft Prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.16,2:16:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 接过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, put him through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.48,2:16:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 我们有麻烦了 - 请待机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony, we have a problem. - Ah, please hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.27,2:16:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.50,2:16:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.11,2:16:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.36,2:16:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you need us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.76,2:16:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you need me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.41,2:16:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.42,2:18:33.52,Title,0,0,0,0,,《美国队长3：内战》
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.19,2:18:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.05,2:18:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能信任自己的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust my own mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.71,2:18:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他们想到办法把洗脑的东西清理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, until they figure out how to get this stuff out of my head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.33,2:18:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想继续沉睡是最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think going back under is the best thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.80,2:19:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对所有人都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.32,2:19:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.17,2:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友和我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend and my father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.08,2:19:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were both victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.46,2:19:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能帮其中一个找到安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can help one of them find peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.81,2:19:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们知道他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if they find out he's here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.77,2:19:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会来抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll come for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.41,2:19:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.50,2:26:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁啊 是谁打了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So. Who was it? Who hit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.50,2:26:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.83,2:26:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,痒死了 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So itchy, man. God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.38,2:26:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个人叫什么 - 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's some guy's name? - Uh, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.22,2:26:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.34,2:26:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哎呦 - 12C那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yikes. - From 12C?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.00,2:26:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,龅牙那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the overbite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.04,2:26:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你不认识他 他布鲁克林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You don't know him, he's from Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.78,2:26:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:50.45,2:26:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你也回敬他了几下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you got a few good licks in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.13,2:26:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我回敬了他好几下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got quite a few in actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.26,2:26:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.19,2:26:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朋友块头可大了 可大可大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His friend was huge. Like huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.94,2:27:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's way better. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.30,2:27:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.20,2:27:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 梅 能带下门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, May. Hey, can you shut the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.25,2:27:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠将回归
